  "summary": "Nanya Technology's new DRAM fab in Taishan District, New Taipei City, Taiwan, designed with a two-story cleanroom and built in phases. The company held a groundbreaking in June 2022. In August 2026 its board approved a first-phase budget of NT$346.6 billion for about 35,900 wafer starts per month over 2026 to 2029. Nanya plans equipment move-in in the first quarter of 2027, first wafer output in the fourth quarter of 2027 and a ramp to 30,000 wafer starts a month by the end of 2028 and 50,000 by 2030.",
